                                        "entry_id": "e717fba3-c40f-3302-a89c-8f7609531076",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To leave the base before the batter hits the ball."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "58056f37-3476-4f34-94fe-a04e3665d9d9",
                                                "sense_id": "1b667025-d241-3efe-977e-0a3e64ef6403",
                                                "text": "This manager, in keeping with all other famous managers, believed that batting was the thing which won games. He developed a hard-hitting team. He kept everlastingly at them to hit and run, hit and run."
